    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今日の仕事はゲーム情報番組じゃろ？\n楽しみで、昨日から落ち着かんかったわ。わはは！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_01:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "しかもワシの好きな格闘ゲーム！\nいつも以上にやる気がみなぎるってもんじゃ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_01:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あ、もちろんどんな仕事もやる気満々じゃけぇ、\nそこは誤解せんでくれ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_01:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "わかってますよ。大吾さんはいつでも\nどんな仕事でも一生懸命ですからね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_01:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "一生懸命やれば、見てくれる人を\nはなまる笑顔にできるかもしれん。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_01:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それに大好きな格闘ゲームじゃけぇ\n活躍してみたいしのぉ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_01:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "コンボがつながった時の楽しさ、\nカウンターが決まった時の高揚感！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_01:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そういうのを見せたら\nワシにも興味を持ってくれるかもしれんのぉー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_01:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●●●●●●●ボスも見とってくれ！\nビシっと技を決めるけぇ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "042dai",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
